node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.development

!**/.env.example
# Sauvegardes et variantes de .env. Constaté en B2 : trois fichiers
# (.env.old, .env.backup-*, .env.bak2-*) contenaient la clé API Resend et le
# JWT_SECRET en clair et n'étaient couverts par AUCUNE règle — un `git add .`
# les aurait commis. La règle `**/.env` ne couvre pas `.env.quelquechose`.
# L'exception `!**/.env.example` ci-dessus reste prioritaire, elle est déclarée
# avant.
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example


infra/supabase/volumes/db/data/
infra/supabase/volumes/storage/

*.log
.DS_Store

playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
infra/worker/.env.worker

# Worker V2 ML model artifacts — generated by ml/train.py, never committed.
# They are reproducible from a registered dataset version + seed.
apps/prospect-worker-v2/ml-artifacts/
apps/prospect-worker-v2/**/__pycache__/

# Public build-time values for the web container (see infra/web/.env.example).
infra/web/.env

# Scheduler DB credentials (see .env.scheduler.example).
infra/scheduler/.env.scheduler

# Local backups / secrets
backups/
*.bak.*
infra/supabase/.env.old
infra/supabase/docker-compose.yml.old

# Never commit private keys
*.pem
*.key
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
id_ed25519_github_fadeup
id_ed25519_github_fadeup.pub
